WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:47.075
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:47.345 --> 01:49.905
Where were you all afternoon?

3
01:49.985 --> 01:52.345
I was asking Shengyang about some things.

4
01:54.865 --> 01:55.825
What things?

5
01:57.065 --> 01:57.905
It's a secret.

6
02:00.505 --> 02:02.265
By the way, I forgot to ask.

7
02:02.345 --> 02:03.905
Why did you join this lab?

8
02:04.825 --> 02:06.185
It's a secret.

9
02:10.265 --> 02:11.545
Professor Qiu found me.

10
02:12.145 --> 02:14.745
He said he saw our work in the Excellence Cup.

11
02:15.345 --> 02:18.105
So you already knew I was coming.

12
02:20.625 --> 02:22.425
Nobody told me you were coming.

13
02:23.865 --> 02:26.665
Really? But you seem to know a lot of people here.

14
02:27.785 --> 02:28.625
Who?

15
02:33.345 --> 02:34.705
I meant…

16
02:35.425 --> 02:36.545
Never mind.

17
02:37.265 --> 02:39.145
If you're not busy later,

18
02:39.225 --> 02:40.425
let's get dinner.

19
02:40.505 --> 02:42.585
Not today. I have to work at the store.

20
02:43.385 --> 02:44.745
I'll be busy with research

21
02:44.825 --> 02:46.465
and won't get to work as much.

22
02:58.865 --> 03:00.945
You asked for time off. Why did you come?

23
03:02.745 --> 03:04.505
You don't have a shift today.

24
03:04.585 --> 03:06.825
And tell me earlier if you want time off too next time.

25
03:08.345 --> 03:11.305
When I took time off before, when 5:30 p.m. came around,

26
03:12.945 --> 03:13.785
what happened?

27
03:13.865 --> 03:15.705
What do you mean?

28
03:20.105 --> 03:21.585
Do you mean Xiaoyang?

29
03:25.665 --> 03:27.705
He doesn't go to school every day.

30
03:27.785 --> 03:31.665
Besides, when that happens, I go to pick him up first

31
03:31.745 --> 03:34.625
and take him to his grandparents.

32
03:35.465 --> 03:37.265
Then I come back to the store.

33
03:37.865 --> 03:41.345
The two elders have difficulty walking and can't pick him up,

34
03:41.425 --> 03:43.505
but they can watch him at home just fine.

35
03:43.585 --> 03:45.065
Besides,

36
03:45.145 --> 03:47.825
the special education school's teachers are very nice.

37
03:49.025 --> 03:49.865
Why do you ask?

38
03:51.345 --> 03:53.265
I got into a school lab.

39
03:53.345 --> 03:55.545
I will be taking more time off.

40
03:55.625 --> 03:56.985
So…

41
03:59.265 --> 04:01.625
you may need to hire another person.

42
04:16.184 --> 04:18.425
You took one day off last month.

43
04:18.504 --> 04:19.905
I deducted that.

44
04:19.985 --> 04:21.465
This is the total. Check it.

45
04:21.545 --> 04:23.225
-Correct? -Yes.

46
04:24.185 --> 04:25.425
You're fast.

47
04:26.025 --> 04:28.585
Did you calculate it several times before coming?

48
04:28.665 --> 04:30.665
You sure won't take a loss.

49
04:30.745 --> 04:32.705
Okay, I've transferred it to you.

50
04:35.465 --> 04:37.345
It's good to be sharp.

51
04:40.345 --> 04:43.105
Until you find another part-timer,

52
04:43.185 --> 04:46.665
if you can't manage, you can contact me.

53
04:48.705 --> 04:49.905
You worry too much.

54
04:49.985 --> 04:52.425
Plenty of students want to work here.

55
04:53.105 --> 04:54.065
Don't worry.

56
04:55.505 --> 04:56.785
Go on.

57
05:14.585 --> 05:16.465
You… You go do your best.

58
05:20.505 --> 05:21.705
I'll also do my best.

59
05:59.145 --> 06:01.305
Mr. Lu, here's your package.

60
06:04.025 --> 06:06.505
Mr. Lu, is the power outlet not working?

61
06:06.585 --> 06:08.665
-It's fine. -Then why are you removing it?

62
06:08.745 --> 06:12.625
Didn't you put this extra-long power strip to charge devices here?

63
06:14.385 --> 06:15.825
It isn't needed anymore.

64
06:25.385 --> 06:28.545
Only six people in the class scored over 90 points this time.

65
06:30.785 --> 06:33.265
Isn't your goal to be in the top 35 of your grade?

66
06:33.345 --> 06:35.385
What rank does 90 points get you?

67
06:42.145 --> 06:44.145
Never mind. It's still worth rewarding.

68
06:45.105 --> 06:46.225
What's the reward?

69
06:46.305 --> 06:48.665
Did you finish those math problems last time?

70
06:49.345 --> 06:50.505
I can teach you.

71
06:50.585 --> 06:52.025
It doesn't count as a lesson.

72
06:52.105 --> 06:53.985
How is that considered a reward?

73
06:54.705 --> 06:55.985
Give me the math problems.

74
06:56.825 --> 06:58.905
No need. I've taken care of it.

75
06:58.985 --> 07:00.905
I met a young teacher at school.

76
07:00.985 --> 07:02.825
I can go to him for any problems.

77
07:02.905 --> 07:04.105
You don't have to worry.

78
07:05.545 --> 07:06.745
Let's start the lesson.

79
07:08.265 --> 07:11.985
Okay. Today, let's go over…

80
07:15.465 --> 07:17.105
Hello. Here's your delivery.

81
07:18.585 --> 07:20.025
Delivery?

82
07:34.185 --> 07:36.745
Let's start with where you made the most mistakes.

83
07:36.825 --> 07:40.185
In a double-stranded DNA molecule, adenine accounts for…

84
07:44.665 --> 07:46.225
Hello. Here's your delivery.

85
07:53.225 --> 07:55.025
We're here for a lesson, not…

86
07:57.985 --> 07:59.345
We're not having a picnic.

87
07:59.945 --> 08:01.425
Okay, it won't happen again.

88
08:04.865 --> 08:06.585
In a double-stranded DNA molecule,

89
08:06.665 --> 08:09.105
adenine accounts for 20% of all bases.

90
08:09.185 --> 08:11.225
Therefore, cytosine accounts for…

91
08:18.665 --> 08:20.865
How many more deliveries are there?

92
08:20.945 --> 08:21.905
I don't know.

93
08:21.985 --> 08:23.025
Gao Xing.

94
08:23.705 --> 08:25.185
I really don't know

95
08:25.265 --> 08:28.785
because I didn't order these.

96
08:36.985 --> 08:40.065
Someone already cooks for Gao Xing. Why order so much takeout?

97
08:40.664 --> 08:44.225
Even aside from that, it's all delivered during tutoring. It's disruptive.

98
08:46.185 --> 08:47.305
I'm taking care of her

99
08:47.905 --> 08:48.825
as her cousin.

100
08:49.785 --> 08:51.945
I never realized you were so thoughtful.

101
08:53.225 --> 08:54.305
You're just dense.

102
08:55.825 --> 08:57.865
I didn't order for her alone.

103
08:57.945 --> 08:58.985
Tutoring her

104
08:59.065 --> 09:01.905
is physical labor, not mental labor.

105
09:01.985 --> 09:04.545
Besides, you're going to be busy with the lab now.

106
09:05.985 --> 09:07.225
I…

107
09:07.905 --> 09:10.745
What's up? Is joining the lab stressing you out?

108
09:13.465 --> 09:14.345
It's new to me.

109
09:16.025 --> 09:17.425
But it's okay.

110
09:17.505 --> 09:19.345
The first step is always the hardest.

111
09:19.425 --> 09:21.145
I have reading to do. See you.

112
09:49.425 --> 09:52.145
It's affected by impaired lactate metabolism.

113
09:52.225 --> 09:54.025
The teacher mentioned it last time.

114
10:00.145 --> 10:01.185
Zheng Yu.

115
10:03.545 --> 10:06.185
This is the experimental project I told you about.

116
10:06.265 --> 10:07.305
Take a look.

117
10:08.825 --> 10:10.985
Do you have that many questions?

118
10:11.065 --> 10:12.785
We're the ones in a team.

119
10:15.585 --> 10:16.745
You don't get it.

120
10:20.065 --> 10:21.585
I had heard about it before.

121
10:22.385 --> 10:24.945
Our boss originally wanted to bring only you on.

122
10:25.025 --> 10:26.545
You have experience, after all.

123
10:26.625 --> 10:29.385
But Shengyang strongly recommended Zheng Yu.

124
10:29.465 --> 10:32.025
That's why the two of you joined at the same time.

125
10:32.105 --> 10:33.505
So?

126
10:34.785 --> 10:36.345
So don't be so dense.

127
10:36.945 --> 10:39.265
He wants to show Zheng Yu the ropes. Let him.

128
10:39.865 --> 10:41.145
We'll be right here,

129
10:41.745 --> 10:43.785
the hidden threat that he is unaware of.

130
10:46.305 --> 10:48.105
Wait for luck to fall into our laps.

131
10:48.185 --> 10:49.385
Do you have free time?

132
10:50.105 --> 10:51.385
Why aren't you working?

133
10:53.385 --> 10:54.785
It's only 11:00 a.m.

134
10:55.705 --> 10:59.385
Before 1:00 p.m., anything more complex than brewing coffee is beyond me.

135
11:01.905 --> 11:04.105
Then why did you come in so early?

136
11:05.905 --> 11:07.065
You don't get it.

137
11:07.705 --> 11:10.505
I need to spend all morning convincing myself

138
11:10.585 --> 11:12.785
to do experiments all afternoon.

139
11:18.585 --> 11:20.105
Did you run into a problem?

140
11:20.185 --> 11:22.185
-I can take a look. -No need.

141
11:26.305 --> 11:27.905
Are you coming this afternoon?

142
11:29.065 --> 11:30.105
Yes.

143
11:30.785 --> 11:32.785
Then let's have lunch together.

144
11:33.985 --> 11:35.185
Not today.

145
11:35.265 --> 11:37.145
I have lunch plans.

146
11:41.305 --> 11:43.025
Didn't you hear anything I said?

147
11:45.265 --> 11:46.385
What did you say?

148
11:49.745 --> 11:52.385
I understand that lonely and helpless feeling

149
11:52.465 --> 11:55.665
of being an undergraduate in the lab.

150
11:56.945 --> 12:00.265
But that's no reason for you to be so possessive of your classmate,

151
12:00.345 --> 12:01.665
right?

152
12:02.185 --> 12:04.785
Come on. I'm older. I'll take you to lunch.

153
12:04.865 --> 12:06.145
Bi Dezheng.

154
12:07.905 --> 12:09.785
It means "I must get a diploma."

155
12:11.665 --> 12:12.745
What year are you in?

156
12:13.625 --> 12:14.465
Junior year.

157
12:14.545 --> 12:16.025
Then I'm older than you.

158
12:21.585 --> 12:23.545
Then take me to lunch, bro.

159
12:23.625 --> 12:25.185
Wait up, bro.

160
12:29.545 --> 12:31.745
You really don't have to treat me to a meal.

161
12:31.825 --> 12:32.985
I didn't do anything.

162
12:33.785 --> 12:36.225
The materials you found for me were very useful.

163
12:38.145 --> 12:40.385
This is a nice spread. Thank you.

164
12:47.185 --> 12:49.505
Did you add that WeChat account I sent you?

165
12:49.585 --> 12:50.545
Yes.

166
12:50.625 --> 12:52.705
I already set up a time to talk to her.

167
12:52.785 --> 12:55.505
That's great. An undergrad classmate recommended her.

168
12:56.105 --> 12:57.865
He met her in grad school.

169
12:57.945 --> 12:59.545
She later went to study abroad

170
12:59.625 --> 13:02.465
and now works at that research institute you mentioned.

171
13:02.545 --> 13:03.465
I see.

172
13:06.865 --> 13:09.265
Do you plan to study abroad?

173
13:10.625 --> 13:12.745
No, I'm asking for a friend.

174
13:14.385 --> 13:17.385
I knew it. There's no way you would study abroad.

175
13:22.265 --> 13:25.185
Yes. How could I possibly study abroad?

176
13:28.505 --> 13:30.065
Sorry, don't misunderstand.

177
13:30.145 --> 13:31.905
That's not what I meant.

178
13:31.985 --> 13:32.985
What I meant to say

179
13:33.065 --> 13:35.825
is that I've looked into studying abroad too.

180
13:35.905 --> 13:38.065
Living expenses abroad

181
13:38.145 --> 13:39.665
are very high.

182
13:40.785 --> 13:42.265
Just on the issue of lodging,

183
13:42.345 --> 13:44.745
getting student housing isn't guaranteed.

184
13:44.825 --> 13:47.945
Even if you get approved, it costs a lot.

185
13:48.025 --> 13:50.745
I think our situation now is quite nice.

186
13:50.825 --> 13:53.945
You have a high chance of getting into the graduate program.

187
13:54.025 --> 13:55.825
Later, you can aim to be a postdoc.

188
13:55.905 --> 13:59.505
This way, we can still work in the same city.

189
14:04.585 --> 14:05.425
What's wrong?

190
14:08.625 --> 14:09.865
Nothing.

191
14:11.665 --> 14:12.785
Dig in.

192
14:19.505 --> 14:21.425
By the way, what friend

193
14:21.505 --> 14:23.105
are you doing all this for?

194
14:27.745 --> 14:29.465
A very important friend.

195
14:36.505 --> 14:39.265
Should we eat at the cafeteria or a restaurant?

196
14:39.345 --> 14:41.585
The cafeteria is too far. Let's stay nearby.

197
14:41.665 --> 14:43.945
Sure. What cuisine are you thinking of?

198
14:44.025 --> 14:45.265
Anything is fine.

199
14:46.345 --> 14:48.905
I'll ask my roommates

200
14:48.985 --> 14:50.985
if they have any recommendations.

201
15:14.705 --> 15:17.065
They say there is a good burger place nearby.

202
15:17.145 --> 15:19.745
-I think it's next door. -Let's go to the cafeteria.

203
15:21.105 --> 15:22.305
Why?

204
15:23.265 --> 15:24.705
I hate burgers.

205
15:24.785 --> 15:27.185
-The cafeteria is too far. -My treat.

206
15:27.265 --> 15:28.665
Order anything you want.

207
15:30.145 --> 15:31.225
Movement is medicine.

208
15:31.305 --> 15:33.385
I don't mind walking a few more steps.

209
15:41.225 --> 15:42.905
Zheng Yu said she was coming back.

210
15:42.985 --> 15:44.665
Is she still not here?

211
15:48.625 --> 15:50.945
Shengyang isn't back either.

212
15:52.185 --> 15:53.625
Zheng Yu said she had plans.

213
15:53.705 --> 15:55.065
Was it with Shengyang?

214
15:55.145 --> 15:56.025
It's 1:00 p.m.

215
15:56.105 --> 15:58.345
You can do more complex things now, right?

216
16:12.625 --> 16:14.265
After you talk to her tonight,

217
16:14.345 --> 16:16.145
tell me if you have more questions.

218
16:16.225 --> 16:17.865
I'll figure something out.

219
16:17.945 --> 16:20.185
No, it's okay. You've helped me enough.

220
16:20.265 --> 16:21.585
Your friend is my friend.

221
16:21.665 --> 16:23.265
Helping is only right.

222
16:23.345 --> 16:24.585
Thank you.

223
16:28.865 --> 16:30.665
Zheng Yu, you're finally back.

224
16:31.785 --> 16:34.065
Did Chen Yanzhou send you this research paper?

225
16:34.665 --> 16:35.505
No.

226
16:36.945 --> 16:38.265
Send it. I'll read it now.

227
16:39.265 --> 16:40.145
Bi Dezheng.

228
16:40.705 --> 16:41.865
You send it to her.

229
16:44.025 --> 16:45.305
My phone is in the locker.

230
16:48.745 --> 16:49.945
I'll send it to you.

231
17:06.464 --> 17:07.424
What?

232
17:07.505 --> 17:09.224
Do you want a coffee?

233
17:11.224 --> 17:13.704
Coffee isn't good for my health.

234
17:19.505 --> 17:20.625
You're acting weird today.

235
17:22.265 --> 17:23.385
No, I'm not.

236
17:24.865 --> 17:26.704
Are you mad at me for coming late,

237
17:26.785 --> 17:28.305
not reading the paper,

238
17:28.385 --> 17:30.545
and holding up our team's progress?

239
17:31.265 --> 17:32.745
No.

240
17:32.825 --> 17:34.465
-Then you-- -Zheng Yu.

241
17:35.145 --> 17:37.865
I want to put my samples through centrifugal washing.

242
17:37.945 --> 17:39.105
Are you free to help?

243
17:39.705 --> 17:40.785
No problem.

244
17:58.465 --> 18:00.345
What's going on?

245
18:00.425 --> 18:02.265
What is the matter with him?

246
18:02.345 --> 18:05.985
T-CELL RECEPTORS DISTANCE-BASED CLUSTERING APPROACHES

247
18:19.505 --> 18:20.505
Yanzhou?

248
18:21.105 --> 18:23.865
Are you preparing for the Olympics so late at night?

249
18:23.945 --> 18:24.865
Use your brain.

250
18:24.945 --> 18:26.305
It's not an Olympic event.

251
18:30.105 --> 18:31.305
What is that smell?

252
18:31.865 --> 18:33.105
Vinegar.

253
18:35.745 --> 18:37.425
Go home after you toss the trash.

254
18:41.105 --> 18:42.465
You're one to talk.

255
18:45.265 --> 18:46.145
JIANG MIAN

256
18:46.225 --> 18:47.865
When are you coming for pick-up?

257
18:49.625 --> 18:51.865
Don't you deliver it to me?

258
18:52.625 --> 18:54.225
That costs extra.

259
18:54.305 --> 18:57.785
Have it ready during the morning exercise!

260
18:58.665 --> 19:00.265
Linlin, Zhuang Ning,

261
19:00.345 --> 19:02.905
I'm so glad to be alive to see you.

262
19:03.825 --> 19:05.785
Is your night class over?

263
19:05.865 --> 19:07.545
I'm never failing another course.

264
19:07.625 --> 19:09.505
The repeated course is at night.

265
19:09.585 --> 19:11.505
I'm half dead after class.

266
19:11.585 --> 19:12.745
Drink. Revive yourself.

267
19:13.945 --> 19:14.785
Let's go.

268
19:15.545 --> 19:17.785
Besides, don't… What's that…

269
19:18.465 --> 19:19.945
It's…

270
19:20.905 --> 19:21.985
Sorry.

271
19:31.065 --> 19:32.345
Any dirty clothes to wash?

272
19:39.145 --> 19:40.505
Something is off about you.

273
19:41.145 --> 19:42.825
Zheng Yu, what happened?

274
19:42.905 --> 19:44.465
How can we help?

275
19:46.305 --> 19:50.025
If someone suddenly starts talking to you less,

276
19:50.745 --> 19:51.665
what's the reason?

277
19:57.145 --> 20:00.585
So you went out to eat and came back,

278
20:00.665 --> 20:02.625
and his attitude towards you did a 180.

279
20:03.305 --> 20:06.105
It's not that dramatic. It's just different from usual.

280
20:06.185 --> 20:08.505
Who did you go out to eat with?

281
20:10.225 --> 20:11.705
An upperclassman in the lab.

282
20:11.785 --> 20:13.385
His name is Duan Shengyang.

283
20:13.465 --> 20:17.105
I've known him for a long time. I had to talk to him today.

284
20:17.785 --> 20:18.945
Is it possible

285
20:19.025 --> 20:21.705
that he's talking less, not because you were late,

286
20:21.785 --> 20:24.145
but because of the reason you were late?

287
20:31.905 --> 20:34.305
Forget it. I'm going to do laundry.

288
20:38.185 --> 20:41.385
Why didn't you say anything? Don't you usually have an opinion?

289
20:42.225 --> 20:44.825
Analyzing back and forth is pointless.

290
20:44.905 --> 20:48.145
Why not take action and help Zheng Yu verify it?

291
20:48.945 --> 20:49.785
How?

292
20:50.385 --> 20:53.105
I just saw a post from a senior in media studies

293
20:53.185 --> 20:56.105
saying their college is holding a singles mixer.

294
20:56.945 --> 20:59.345
I have the ultimate plan.

295
21:02.945 --> 21:06.145
Fangli, we're going to that singles mixer later, remember?

296
21:06.225 --> 21:07.705
That's not the point.

297
21:07.785 --> 21:09.625
-Then what is? -It's Zheng Yu.

298
21:09.705 --> 21:11.425
Come on. He's getting away.

299
21:11.505 --> 21:13.625
Of course I won't forget.

300
21:13.705 --> 21:16.785
But Zheng Yu finally agreed to go to the mixer.

301
21:16.865 --> 21:19.585
Don't forget to remind her not to be late.

302
21:19.665 --> 21:21.665
It starts at seven this evening, right?

303
21:21.745 --> 21:22.665
-Yes. -Yes.

304
21:22.745 --> 21:25.025
I'll call her later to remind her.

305
21:25.105 --> 21:26.785
Call early so she leaves early.

306
21:26.865 --> 21:29.945
Linghu Park is a bit far from campus.

307
21:30.025 --> 21:33.225
-Being late gives a bad impression. -Yes.

308
21:33.305 --> 21:37.705
I wonder how many people will ask for her contact info.

309
21:37.785 --> 21:39.425
She should be in the lab.

310
21:39.505 --> 21:42.425
Tell her to invite Shengyang

311
21:42.505 --> 21:44.065
and join in the fun.

312
21:44.145 --> 21:46.585
Good idea!

313
21:56.905 --> 21:58.225
The act is finally over.

314
21:58.905 --> 22:01.025
Let's go get afternoon tea. My treat.

315
22:01.105 --> 22:02.505
No, wait.

316
22:02.585 --> 22:03.745
Will this work?

317
22:04.465 --> 22:06.745
I think it's hard to say.

318
22:06.825 --> 22:07.985
We've cast the line.

319
22:08.065 --> 22:10.665
Whether the fish takes the bait is up to fate.

320
22:10.745 --> 22:13.185
Let's go. Come on.

321
22:15.585 --> 22:17.065
Zheng Yu.

322
22:17.145 --> 22:17.985
Come here.

323
22:24.065 --> 22:27.785
Isn't this data figure different from what we said yesterday?

324
22:33.425 --> 22:35.985
Does Zheng Yu seem different from usual today?

325
22:37.825 --> 22:38.985
Does she?

326
22:40.785 --> 22:42.665
Her outfit today

327
22:42.745 --> 22:43.585
is new.

328
22:46.705 --> 22:49.425
Bro, we wear a lab coat every day.

329
22:49.505 --> 22:51.465
How can you remember what she has worn?

330
22:54.505 --> 22:55.705
She put on makeup today.

331
22:57.665 --> 22:58.705
Did she?

332
23:00.265 --> 23:02.265
Doesn't she look the same as yesterday?

333
23:07.585 --> 23:08.745
I lost again.

334
23:08.825 --> 23:11.105
It's all your fault for distracting me.

335
23:15.985 --> 23:19.105
HIGH SCHOOL AFFILIATED WITH QING YI UNIVERSITY

336
23:19.185 --> 23:20.265
Let's go do our laps.

337
23:20.345 --> 23:22.185
I'm not going today.

338
23:22.265 --> 23:23.945
Cover for me if they do roll call.

339
23:24.025 --> 23:27.505
The dean has been doing daily patrols lately.

340
23:27.585 --> 23:29.345
Don't worry. I'm not dumb.

341
23:29.425 --> 23:31.025
I won't stay here to get caught.

342
23:32.505 --> 23:33.945
Be careful.

343
23:34.025 --> 23:35.105
Bye.

344
23:48.905 --> 23:50.225
You're five minutes late.

345
23:51.345 --> 23:52.665
Short legs make me slow.

346
23:52.745 --> 23:53.905
Then why meet up here?

347
23:53.985 --> 23:56.585
We had to come so far just for a handover.

348
23:56.665 --> 23:58.065
"Just for a handover"?

349
23:58.145 --> 24:01.225
I have to check it. I want a refund if I'm not satisfied.

350
24:28.745 --> 24:30.625
JIANG MIAN

351
24:38.345 --> 24:39.545
Do you know the answers?

352
24:39.625 --> 24:41.465
Why don't you just submit it?

353
24:41.545 --> 24:43.305
If you fail, I'll refund you.

354
24:43.385 --> 24:45.745
Don't assume I don't know what you're up to.

355
24:45.825 --> 24:46.785
If I fail,

356
24:46.865 --> 24:48.545
I won't live to spend that money.

357
24:50.625 --> 24:53.465
You make it sound like the teacher will eat you alive.

358
24:55.625 --> 24:57.425
The dean.

359
25:03.225 --> 25:05.345
Are you lying to me?

360
25:05.425 --> 25:06.745
He should be patrolling.

361
25:06.825 --> 25:08.185
He wouldn't be here.

362
25:08.265 --> 25:10.305
No, I really did see him.

363
25:10.825 --> 25:12.425
I can testify he didn't lie.

364
25:12.505 --> 25:15.425
See? I'm not that ridiculous.

365
25:25.585 --> 25:27.385
Which classes are you two from?

366
25:27.465 --> 25:29.345
What are you doing in the garden

367
25:29.425 --> 25:31.465
instead of doing your morning laps?

368
25:32.465 --> 25:33.585
Speak.

369
25:33.665 --> 25:35.265
We're in Year 3.

370
25:35.345 --> 25:36.665
We don't have to do laps.

371
25:36.745 --> 25:38.705
Sir, we're too stressed out.

372
25:38.785 --> 25:40.585
We came out to take a break

373
25:41.505 --> 25:43.225
and eat an apple to fuel up.

374
25:44.105 --> 25:45.625
Year 3? Which class?

375
25:45.705 --> 25:47.585
Come on, show me your student ID.

376
25:50.705 --> 25:51.945
Come on.

377
25:56.145 --> 25:57.785
"Gao Xing."

378
25:57.865 --> 25:59.225
REGISTERED CLASS

379
25:59.305 --> 26:00.345
"Year 1, Class 5."

380
26:01.905 --> 26:03.065
Where is yours?

381
26:11.865 --> 26:13.505
"Jiang Mian."

382
26:13.585 --> 26:15.065
REGISTERED CLASS

383
26:15.145 --> 26:16.145
Year 2, Class 8.

384
26:17.425 --> 26:19.545
One is in Year 1, the other is in Year 2.

385
26:19.625 --> 26:21.305
Together, that's Year 3, is it?

386
26:22.385 --> 26:24.785
What were you doing in the garden at this hour?

387
26:24.865 --> 26:28.465
In last week's speech, didn't I talk about the issue of dating?

388
26:31.825 --> 26:33.825
Go get your homeroom teachers.

389
26:39.345 --> 26:40.985
Mr. Huang, I swear,

390
26:41.065 --> 26:43.105
I was just asking him math questions.

391
26:47.145 --> 26:47.985
Sir,

392
26:48.065 --> 26:50.545
this is indeed the math assignment

393
26:50.625 --> 26:52.505
that I gave to Gao Xing.

394
26:52.585 --> 26:54.385
She has done an excellent job.

395
26:54.465 --> 26:56.105
Look at these advanced problems.

396
26:56.185 --> 26:57.785
The steps to solving them

397
26:57.865 --> 26:59.585
are written out beautifully.

398
26:59.665 --> 27:00.505
It shows

399
27:00.585 --> 27:03.025
her clear understanding of the concepts.

400
27:04.905 --> 27:06.305
-Mr. Huang, I meant-- -Sir.

401
27:07.785 --> 27:09.985
Ms. Sun, it's good that you're here.

402
27:11.545 --> 27:12.905
Your class's Jiang Mian

403
27:12.985 --> 27:13.865
has so much time

404
27:13.945 --> 27:16.465
that he's starting to teach first-year math.

405
27:16.545 --> 27:17.865
I like his enthusiasm,

406
27:17.945 --> 27:19.865
but I'm afraid he will use this

407
27:19.945 --> 27:21.145
to start dating.

408
27:22.385 --> 27:24.905
Sir, this isn't early romance.

409
27:39.625 --> 27:42.225
You're doing homework for others and charging for it.

410
27:43.585 --> 27:45.745
Do you approach them?

411
27:48.665 --> 27:50.825
Say something. What's with this attitude?

412
27:51.545 --> 27:52.985
Call your parents here.

413
27:53.065 --> 27:55.625
Sir, I'm the one who approached Jiang Mian.

414
27:57.105 --> 27:57.945
It's my fault.

415
27:58.545 --> 28:00.025
I led him astray.

416
28:00.105 --> 28:01.585
We won't do it again.

417
28:01.665 --> 28:04.265
And you. Do you think you can get away with it?

418
28:04.345 --> 28:07.145
Paying others to do your homework? Call your parents too!

419
28:07.225 --> 28:08.465
I can't.

420
28:08.545 --> 28:10.785
My mom is on a business trip. She can't come.

421
28:10.865 --> 28:12.425
Mr. Huang knows my situation.

422
28:12.505 --> 28:13.465
Yes.

423
28:13.545 --> 28:16.385
Sir, Gao Xing's mother is rather busy.

424
28:16.465 --> 28:18.385
She hasn't come in before.

425
28:18.465 --> 28:20.025
We communicate online.

426
28:21.665 --> 28:23.585
Your mom is busy. Call your dad in.

427
28:23.665 --> 28:25.025
That won't work either.

428
28:25.785 --> 28:26.705
Your dad…

429
28:26.785 --> 28:28.345
I'm not worried about myself.

430
28:29.305 --> 28:30.665
I'm worried about you.

431
28:30.745 --> 28:32.025
What for?

432
28:35.785 --> 28:37.545
My dad has been dead for years.

433
28:43.305 --> 28:44.905
-What happened? -I don't know.

434
28:49.425 --> 28:50.505
Here's what we'll do.

435
28:50.585 --> 28:52.905
You must get an adult who can manage you

436
28:52.985 --> 28:55.585
to speak with me this afternoon, okay?

437
28:56.225 --> 28:57.305
And you.

438
28:58.145 --> 28:59.025
Stand straight.

439
29:01.585 --> 29:03.185
Charging to do homework?

440
29:13.665 --> 29:15.865
CHEN HUIMEI

441
29:22.985 --> 29:25.665
My dad has been dead for years.

442
29:31.305 --> 29:32.625
Just tell them

443
29:32.705 --> 29:35.065
I was looking for business, and you got scammed.

444
29:37.945 --> 29:42.025
You couldn't tell a lie to save yourself. Would I fall for your scam?

445
29:43.625 --> 29:45.945
I will take responsibility for my own actions.

446
29:46.025 --> 29:48.665
You should think about how you will explain it

447
29:48.745 --> 29:50.185
to your parents.

448
30:16.185 --> 30:17.625
Why are you here alone?

449
30:18.745 --> 30:19.625
Getting some air.

450
30:24.425 --> 30:26.745
Today, are you going to--

451
30:26.825 --> 30:29.985
Zheng Yu, did you wash the coffee machine in the break room?

452
30:30.065 --> 30:31.985
When I was making coffee for others,

453
30:32.065 --> 30:34.625
I saw it was dirty, so I washed it.

454
30:35.505 --> 30:36.905
We're on the same team.

455
30:38.025 --> 30:39.505
How come I haven't gotten any?

456
30:40.705 --> 30:43.305
Didn't you say coffee is bad for your health?

457
30:43.385 --> 30:44.505
Is your health bad?

458
30:46.065 --> 30:46.905
I'm very healthy.

459
30:53.865 --> 30:55.145
Rushing her already.

460
30:56.265 --> 30:57.385
What did you say?

461
30:58.825 --> 31:00.145
I said,

462
31:00.225 --> 31:02.025
is there a problem with the machine?

463
31:02.785 --> 31:04.065
No.

464
31:04.145 --> 31:05.665
I just think

465
31:06.705 --> 31:07.905
Zheng Yu is a real gem.

466
31:10.505 --> 31:12.665
I bought the machine in sophomore year.

467
31:13.625 --> 31:14.985
You know, in this lab,

468
31:15.065 --> 31:17.985
other than me, she's the first one to wash it.

469
31:18.065 --> 31:19.705
You don't get it.

470
31:19.785 --> 31:22.185
Everyone uses it to make coffee every day.

471
31:22.265 --> 31:25.105
But not one person has ever washed it.

472
31:25.185 --> 31:27.385
I wash it whenever I can't stand it anymore.

473
31:30.145 --> 31:32.865
Looks like you haven't enjoyed your two years here.

474
31:34.825 --> 31:36.745
It's not about enjoying it or not.

475
31:36.825 --> 31:38.385
I've been here for two years.

476
31:38.465 --> 31:39.825
I don't feel like I belong.

477
31:41.145 --> 31:42.785
Even now,

478
31:43.385 --> 31:46.945
whenever I come here, I feel like I'm sneaking into someone's house.

479
31:51.065 --> 31:52.945
Do all undergrads feel the same way?

480
31:53.025 --> 31:54.705
Don't look at me. I don't.

481
32:00.505 --> 32:02.745
But since we're a team,

482
32:02.825 --> 32:05.625
get rid of that feeling and do the work.

483
32:14.265 --> 32:15.665
Zheng Yu, are you leaving?

484
32:17.425 --> 32:18.665
I have something to do.

485
32:22.585 --> 32:24.105
Leaving early.

486
32:24.185 --> 32:25.705
But you don't have to leave this early.

487
32:28.025 --> 32:29.345
Are you leaving too?

488
32:33.665 --> 32:34.705
Bye.

489
32:40.665 --> 32:41.625
Hello?

490
32:42.345 --> 32:49.145
HIGH SCHOOL AFFILIATED WITH QING YI UNIVERSITY

491
32:53.705 --> 32:55.585
Ms. Zheng, over here!

492
33:11.145 --> 33:13.745
How is the outfit? I borrowed it from my roommate.

493
33:14.945 --> 33:15.905
It will do.

494
33:16.465 --> 33:17.745
Don't worry.

495
33:17.825 --> 33:20.225
Mr. Huang is clueless about anything

496
33:20.305 --> 33:21.585
outside of mathematics.

497
33:21.665 --> 33:22.505
Let's go.

498
33:23.305 --> 33:25.225
The phone call was too short.

499
33:25.305 --> 33:27.025
I didn't get the chance to ask.

500
33:27.105 --> 33:29.945
What's this about someone doing your homework for you?

501
33:30.025 --> 33:32.105
It's what it sounds like.

502
33:33.745 --> 33:35.865
The young teacher you mentioned last time

503
33:35.945 --> 33:37.265
isn't really a teacher

504
33:37.345 --> 33:39.505
but a boy one year above you.

505
33:41.105 --> 33:43.345
And he didn't teach you math.

506
33:43.425 --> 33:45.505
He straight up did your homework for you.

507
33:49.585 --> 33:51.545
How did you trick this young boy?

508
33:51.625 --> 33:52.865
He's in Year 2

509
33:52.945 --> 33:56.185
and helping you instead of prepping for the College Entrance Exam.

510
33:56.265 --> 33:57.585
I lured him with money.

511
33:57.665 --> 33:59.145
You're quite smug.

512
34:01.105 --> 34:03.345
Are you telling me the truth? It's not dating?

513
34:06.625 --> 34:09.105
Although this boy is pretty good-looking,

514
34:09.945 --> 34:12.505
from my observations,

515
34:12.585 --> 34:13.945
dating him

516
34:14.025 --> 34:15.945
would be quite boring.

517
34:16.025 --> 34:18.665
You actually dared to think about it and observe him.

518
34:21.824 --> 34:24.225
You didn't tell Yanzhou that you're coming here

519
34:24.304 --> 34:25.665
to see my teacher, did you?

520
34:25.744 --> 34:27.145
If he finds out,

521
34:27.225 --> 34:29.425
then my uncle and aunt will know too.

522
34:29.505 --> 34:32.465
That's practically the same as telling Chen Huimei.

523
34:34.784 --> 34:36.264
Yanzhou and I

524
34:36.344 --> 34:38.465
might not be as close as you think we are.

525
34:43.065 --> 34:44.105
I knew it.

526
34:44.185 --> 34:47.905
He had to be in trouble to be rollerblading in the middle of the night.

527
34:49.824 --> 34:51.784
Ms. Zheng, wait for me!

528
34:55.025 --> 34:56.264
Mr. Huang.

529
34:57.825 --> 35:00.825
Gao Xing, what took you so long? I thought you'd run off!

530
35:00.905 --> 35:03.745
Mr. Huang, school isn't over yet. Where can I run off to?

531
35:04.345 --> 35:06.385
Besides, am I that kind of person?

532
35:09.225 --> 35:10.865
Who is this?

533
35:10.945 --> 35:12.305
This is my…

534
35:13.105 --> 35:14.305
cousin's wife.

535
35:21.065 --> 35:23.065
Hello, you must be Mr. Huang.

536
35:24.425 --> 35:27.105
Yes. Shall we go inside?

537
35:27.185 --> 35:30.185
The boy and his parent are inside already.

538
35:30.265 --> 35:31.385
Come.

539
35:34.105 --> 35:35.705
You cousins look so alike.

540
35:35.785 --> 35:37.865
-Keep an eye on his studies. -Sir.

541
35:37.945 --> 35:39.545
-You must-- -Ms. Sun.

542
35:39.625 --> 35:41.825
-This is Gao Xing's cousin's wife. -Hello.

543
35:41.905 --> 35:43.505
This is Jiang Mian's cousin.

544
35:47.225 --> 35:48.665
W… Whose cousin?

545
35:51.385 --> 35:53.145
Jiang… Jiang Mian's cousin.

546
35:55.825 --> 35:57.705
Why? Is he your cousin?

547
36:11.385 --> 36:13.225
Please take this seriously.

548
36:17.425 --> 36:18.905
Is the customer you mentioned

549
36:18.985 --> 36:20.425
this girl?

550
36:22.225 --> 36:23.425
Yes.

551
36:24.545 --> 36:26.505
Is he that young teacher?

552
36:28.945 --> 36:30.825
But now I'm not sure

553
36:32.065 --> 36:33.345
if I have amnesia.

554
36:34.465 --> 36:35.745
He might be

555
36:35.825 --> 36:37.225
a distant relative.

556
36:37.305 --> 36:39.865
Why else would my cousin be here?

557
36:47.505 --> 36:49.865
ONE HOUR AGO

558
36:49.945 --> 36:51.665
-Hello? -Hello?

559
36:52.905 --> 36:53.745
Jiang Mian?

560
36:53.825 --> 36:55.265
At the hospital,

561
36:55.345 --> 36:57.225
you said I could contact you for help.

562
36:58.105 --> 36:59.985
I did say that,

563
37:00.065 --> 37:03.145
but I remember you threw away my phone number.

564
37:03.225 --> 37:06.785
I memorized it and didn't need it, so of course I tossed it.

565
37:07.705 --> 37:10.745
So did you call because something happened?

566
37:10.825 --> 37:12.105
I need a favor.

567
37:12.825 --> 37:14.585
But you can't tell my sister.

568
37:14.665 --> 37:15.505
Can you

569
37:15.585 --> 37:17.185
come to my school

570
37:17.265 --> 37:19.065
and handle the teachers?

571
37:19.145 --> 37:20.105
Are you in trouble?

572
37:21.545 --> 37:24.105
Send me the address. I'll come now.

573
37:25.145 --> 37:27.545
My homeroom teacher is hard to fool.

574
37:27.625 --> 37:28.825
You…

575
37:28.905 --> 37:30.505
You had better…

576
37:31.425 --> 37:34.025
I've got it. Wait for me at school.

577
37:35.825 --> 37:38.625
Sir, ma'am, let's talk about the kids.

578
37:39.305 --> 37:42.065
I will talk about Gao Xing first.

579
37:42.145 --> 37:44.745
-She hired someone to do her homework. -I was wrong.

580
37:44.825 --> 37:46.345
I will be mindful next time.

581
37:46.425 --> 37:47.345
Next time?

582
37:52.305 --> 37:53.585
I…

583
37:53.665 --> 37:56.025
am helping her discipline the child.

584
37:56.945 --> 37:58.345
You're even doing that?

585
37:59.425 --> 38:02.185
Sir, let me tell you about Jiang Mian's problem.

586
38:02.265 --> 38:03.425
It's even more serious.

587
38:04.025 --> 38:06.345
Doing homework for others with fixed pricing.

588
38:06.425 --> 38:07.865
This is egregious.

589
38:08.745 --> 38:10.545
This is proof of his transactions.

590
38:11.145 --> 38:13.025
He even has tiered pricing.

591
38:13.105 --> 38:16.105
Sometimes, he even charges double for rush jobs.

592
38:16.985 --> 38:18.145
I even paid quadruple.

593
38:23.785 --> 38:25.585
This is outrageous. I'm very sorry.

594
38:26.185 --> 38:27.865
Ma'am, why are you apologizing?

595
38:29.465 --> 38:31.745
You… Are you all family?

596
38:33.465 --> 38:35.945
Lecturing and apologizing for each other?

597
38:42.385 --> 38:44.105
Sir, why are you smiling?

598
38:47.905 --> 38:50.065
Well, let me ask you, are you married?

599
38:51.385 --> 38:53.185
-No. -Do you have a girlfriend?

600
38:54.905 --> 38:56.065
No.

601
38:56.145 --> 38:57.225
I knew it.

602
38:57.305 --> 38:59.225
You're clearly not as mature as her.

603
38:59.945 --> 39:01.905
Ask her for advice when you have time.

604
39:03.025 --> 39:06.225
Yes. I will give her my contact information later.

605
39:07.465 --> 39:10.425
My reason for calling you here isn't to lecture you.

606
39:10.505 --> 39:12.825
It's to understand their situations

607
39:12.905 --> 39:14.785
so this doesn't happen again.

608
39:14.865 --> 39:15.705
-Yes. -Yes.

609
39:17.585 --> 39:18.625
Let's do this.

610
39:18.705 --> 39:22.585
When they get home, they will each write an 8,000-character self-reflection

611
39:22.665 --> 39:23.785
and submit it to me.

612
39:24.545 --> 39:25.745
Isn't that too much?

613
39:26.345 --> 39:28.025
Right. How about fewer words?

614
39:28.905 --> 39:30.625
You two are aligned on this too.

615
39:32.345 --> 39:33.825
Used to spoiling them rotten?

616
39:35.385 --> 39:36.265
It's not much.

617
39:36.345 --> 39:37.945
Right.

618
39:38.025 --> 39:40.785
It's not much. Let's round up to 10,000 characters.

619
39:41.385 --> 39:42.345
See?

620
39:43.065 --> 39:44.345
That's the right attitude.

621
39:46.065 --> 39:47.265
Come in.

622
39:47.345 --> 39:51.265
Sir, Mr. Huang, Ms. Sun, we're waiting for you for the grade-level meeting.

623
39:51.345 --> 39:52.905
Okay, we'll be right there.

624
39:53.585 --> 39:55.385
Okay, let's end here for today.

625
39:56.105 --> 39:57.665
Discipline the kids at home.

626
39:58.305 --> 39:59.185
Thank you.

627
39:59.265 --> 40:01.065
It's not easy being parents now.

628
40:07.505 --> 40:10.225
Gao Xing, when did my sister become your cousin's wife?

629
40:10.305 --> 40:12.505
When did my cousin become your cousin?

630
40:15.345 --> 40:16.265
Your cousin?

631
40:26.105 --> 40:29.105
So he's the brother you said is taking the College Entrance Exam soon?

632
40:31.385 --> 40:32.745
No, wait.

633
40:32.825 --> 40:35.865
Why is one surnamed Jiang and the other Zheng?

634
40:39.825 --> 40:41.545
But that's normal.

635
40:41.625 --> 40:43.585
Chen Yanzhou and Zhou Guanqi

636
40:43.665 --> 40:45.585
are still brothers.

637
40:50.665 --> 40:53.465
I seem to have forgotten to order drinks.

638
40:54.345 --> 40:57.105
Gao Xing, come on. See what you want to drink.

639
41:10.505 --> 41:13.785
Yanzhou, did I just say something wrong?

640
41:17.145 --> 41:19.425
Ms. Zheng's mom is surnamed Jiang.

641
41:20.585 --> 41:23.745
But Jiang Mian wasn't born with his mother's surname.

642
41:24.425 --> 41:26.745
It's because he was adopted by his uncle.

643
41:30.145 --> 41:34.425
The Lunar New Year red packet you gave me and the money you left at the hospital

644
41:35.185 --> 41:37.625
wasn't pocket money you got from Jiang Haixing.

645
41:38.425 --> 41:40.145
A tiny portion was.

646
41:41.385 --> 41:42.665
What about the rest?

647
41:42.745 --> 41:45.145
Did you earn it from doing homework for others?

648
41:45.225 --> 41:46.745
I wanted to help you,

649
41:46.825 --> 41:48.705
but I didn't know how.

650
41:48.785 --> 41:50.065
No, wait.

651
41:50.145 --> 41:51.225
Not help.

652
41:51.305 --> 41:53.305
It's what I should be doing.

653
41:53.385 --> 41:56.425
Taking care of Mom isn't your responsibility alone.

654
41:57.345 --> 42:00.465
Don't do this anymore. Focus on the College Entrance Exam.

655
42:04.345 --> 42:06.545
Only if you score well can you help me.

656
42:08.825 --> 42:10.185
No.

657
42:10.265 --> 42:11.545
It's not helping me.

658
42:12.585 --> 42:14.025
It's your responsibility.

659
42:20.625 --> 42:21.905
Wait.

660
42:23.225 --> 42:25.145
Order a few more dishes.

661
42:25.225 --> 42:27.265
We already ordered plenty.

662
42:27.345 --> 42:29.425
Why order so much for only four people?

663
42:30.025 --> 42:31.185
This way,

664
42:31.865 --> 42:33.305
we can take longer.

665
42:38.025 --> 42:39.105
Take longer?

666
42:40.185 --> 42:41.385
What's up?

667
42:41.465 --> 42:43.705
Will Ms. Zheng do something naughty later?

668
42:44.985 --> 42:46.185
Get going.
